> node --test test/*.test.js

✔ every core field cue has a concise sound caption (1.617833ms)
✔ audio settings clamp channel volumes and expose caption state (0.150041ms)
✔ cue history and threat transitions stay observable without Web Audio (0.242792ms)
✔ cue history remains bounded during a long field session (0.12175ms)
✔ foundation exposes the locked viewport and performance budgets (1.570833ms)
✔ procedural placement is deterministic for a recorded seed (0.109833ms)
✔ representative scene contains all declared subject and pressure groups (0.087041ms)
✔ the family asset exposes two adults, three young and both authored behaviors (15.028167ms)
✔ the glade composition protects a lit family-and-basalt sightline (5.202042ms)
✔ frame percentile is stable and keeps the slow tail visible (0.132542ms)
✔ runtime sources contain no remote asset or CDN request (5.000959ms)
✔ presentation settings normalize invalid persisted values (1.54275ms)
✔ settings round-trip through versioned storage and can be reset (0.173542ms)
✔ blocked or malformed storage falls back without disabling controls (0.1695ms)
✔ the measured compact route starts with a 180-second light budget (1.068208ms)
✔ fresh and restarted player states are clean copies (0.868958ms)
✔ walking, sprinting and crouching have ordered deterministic speeds (0.553917ms)
✔ pause freezes both world time and movement (0.22ms)
✔ a solid obstacle blocks penetration and permits axis sliding (0.220291ms)
✔ leaving the navigable world recovers the last stable position (0.128667ms)
✔ zone topology distinguishes the observation fork and both return routes (0.082916ms)
✔ territory, glade, open proof and cover produce four readable threat states (0.443208ms)
✔ examining the brook makes context eligible without awarding evidence (0.13225ms)
✔ successive observed glade plates record young play and branch pull separately (0.212417ms)
✔ camera raise slows movement and shutter commits one physical plate for two live seconds (0.172416ms)
✔ open proof adds two awareness states and contact cracks the best intact plate (0.182792ms)
✔ a later contact without body margin fails while the first contact remains recoverable (0.06275ms)
✔ a timely raised-rifle shot spends one cartridge and interrupts attack (0.154084ms)
✔ pause freezes a raised camera and live shutter commitment without spending a plate (0.086333ms)
✔ restart clears observation, proof, damage and action history (0.0785ms)
✔ intact evidence and all four result thresholds are deterministic (0.086084ms)
✔ covered return commits its deterministic cost once and submits intact proof at Fort (0.166208ms)
✔ an attack-state exposed return cracks the best plate without spending body margin (0.099667ms)
✔ a fired-shot exposed return costs eighteen seconds and preserves its best plate (0.078333ms)
✔ remaining light expires outside Fort with exact cause and actionable cue (0.06975ms)
